# Accepted findings for the toolchain container image scan (security-scan.yml).
# Each entry needs a reason and a revisit condition; see also SECURITY.md's
# "Known scanner findings (accepted)" section.

# pip's vendored msgpack (the pip in the /opt/pytools venv, under
# pip/_vendor). Used only by pip internally during installs; nothing this
# project builds imports or links it.
# Not fixable here: pip pins its vendored set. Revisit when pip re-vendors.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# pip's vendored setuptools 70.3.0, same vendored set as above. The CVE is a
# path traversal in setuptools' PackageIndex, which pip's internal use never
# exercises. Not fixable here: pip pins its vendored set. Revisit when pip
# re-vendors.
CVE-2025-47273
